You are working on FutureCast, a World-Cup-first friendly football prediction app.

Follow `AGENTS.md` first.

Key constraints:
- Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind, Supabase.
- Private data must be protected by Supabase RLS and server-side authorization.
- AI insights must be grounded in structured provider data only.
- Simulator logic must support FIFA World Cup 2026 format.
- Avoid gambling, paid pools, cash-prize mechanics, and unlicensed logos.
- Keep implementation small, typed, validated, and testable.
